{"00_00-open.mp3":{"dur":16.894,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Our topic today is sharps.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":2.028},{"w":"DANA","t":"The hazards that are easy to miss, why a container beats gloves, and what people on the floor really do.","em":[],"s":2.028,"e":9.872},{"w":"DANA","t":"I'm Dana.","em":[],"s":9.872,"e":11.034},{"w":"RAY","t":"And I'm Ray.","em":[],"s":11.034,"e":11.946},{"w":"DANA","t":"Here we go!","em":[],"s":11.946,"e":13.025}]},"01_01-k1-normal.mp3":{"dur":96.48,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Ray, when we were setting up, you brought up used blades left sitting out.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":4.826},{"w":"DANA","t":"Why do those stick with you?","em":[],"s":4.826,"e":6.661},{"w":"RAY","t":"Honestly, because a used blade is a sharp, just like a needle.","em":[],"s":6.661,"e":11.137},{"w":"RAY","t":"It just doesn't look like one.","em":[],"s":11.137,"e":12.994},{"w":"DANA","t":"I always picture needles.","em":[],"s":12.994,"e":15.253},{"w":"DANA","t":"So what counts as a sharp?","em":[],"s":15.253,"e":17.599},{"w":"RAY","t":"A sharp is anything that can puncture or cut the skin, so a used blade counts.","em":[3],"s":17.517,"e":22.599},{"w":"RAY","t":"Needles still show up too, because some people manage diabetes or allergies with injections.","em":[],"s":22.599,"e":28.537},{"w":"DANA","t":"Right.","em":[],"s":28.455,"e":29.068},{"w":"DANA","t":"So how does a blade end up sitting out?","em":[],"s":29.068,"e":32.567},{"w":"RAY","t":"Say you've just changed a blade, but the sharps container is over by the other station.","em":[],"s":32.485,"e":37.325},{"w":"RAY","t":"So you set the old one on top of your toolbox and think, \"I'll come right back for it.\".","em":[],"s":37.325,"e":42.189},{"w":"DANA","t":"That sounds kind of like something I'd do.","em":[],"s":42.189,"e":44.789},{"w":"DANA","t":"What's the harm if you come right back?","em":[],"s":44.789,"e":47.041},{"w":"RAY","t":"Somebody else might reach for that spot.","em":[],"s":47.041,"e":49.745},{"w":"RAY","t":"A used blade is a hazard whether or not you can see anything on it.","em":[],"s":49.745,"e":53.456},{"w":"DANA","t":"Okay, back up.","em":[],"s":53.374,"e":54.505},{"w":"DANA","t":"Say it's still in your hand.","em":[],"s":54.505,"e":56.691},{"w":"DANA","t":"What do you do?","em":[],"s":56.691,"e":57.897},{"w":"RAY","t":"You take it to the container.","em":[],"s":57.897,"e":59.676},{"w":"RAY","t":"And actually, you plan for this before you pick up the blade.","em":[],"s":59.676,"e":63.325},{"w":"DANA","t":"How so?","em":[],"s":63.243,"e":64.394},{"w":"RAY","t":"There are four steps.","em":[],"s":64.394,"e":65.99},{"w":"RAY","t":"One, know your route to the container before you begin.","em":[],"s":65.99,"e":70.054},{"w":"RAY","t":"Two, use a safer tool if one will do the job.","em":[],"s":70.054,"e":73.397},{"w":"RAY","t":"Three, turn on the safety feature if there is one.","em":[],"s":73.397,"e":77.099},{"w":"RAY","t":"Four, put the blade directly into a designated sharps container.","em":[],"s":77.099,"e":81.747},{"w":"DANA","t":"It doesn't go on the toolbox.","em":[],"s":81.664,"e":83.844},{"w":"DANA","t":"What about the regular trash?","em":[],"s":83.844,"e":86.023},{"w":"RAY","t":"That's out too.","em":[],"s":86.023,"e":87.421},{"w":"RAY","t":"A used blade goes straight into the container, every time.","em":[4],"s":87.421,"e":91.286},{"w":"DANA","t":"Got it.","em":[],"s":91.286,"e":92.273},{"w":"RAY","t":"What I tell crews: don't turn that blade into somebody else's problem.","em":[],"s":92.273,"e":96.48}]},"03_02-k2-normal.mp3":{"dur":87.04,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Let's talk about full sharps containers.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":2.743},{"w":"DANA","t":"I'll admit, I've crammed one more thing into a kitchen trash can that was already full.","em":[],"s":2.743,"e":8.531},{"w":"DANA","t":"I even pushed it down with my hand.","em":[],"s":8.531,"e":10.751},{"w":"RAY","t":"Well, a kitchen trash can is one thing.","em":[],"s":10.751,"e":13.654},{"w":"DANA","t":"So is a full sharps container any different?","em":[],"s":13.654,"e":16.724},{"w":"RAY","t":"It is, because a sharps container has a fill line.","em":[],"s":16.724,"e":20.013},{"w":"RAY","t":"Once the sharps reach that line, the container is full.","em":[9],"s":20.013,"e":23.61},{"w":"DANA","t":"So say it's right at the fill line, but there's still a little gap at the top.","em":[],"s":23.527,"e":29.093},{"w":"DANA","t":"Can you use it?","em":[],"s":29.093,"e":30.08},{"w":"RAY","t":"No, you treat it as full and find another designated container.","em":[],"s":30.08,"e":34.326},{"w":"RAY","t":"If you push one more in, your hand ends up close to the sharps already inside.","em":[],"s":34.326,"e":39.538},{"w":"DANA","t":"Okay, that makes sense.","em":[],"s":39.455,"e":41.228},{"w":"DANA","t":"Is a full container the only thing to watch for?","em":[],"s":41.228,"e":44.847},{"w":"RAY","t":"Actually, there's a second one, and it looks nothing like the first.","em":[8],"s":44.764,"e":49.177},{"w":"RAY","t":"It's a sharp that ends up somewhere it doesn't belong.","em":[],"s":49.177,"e":52.646},{"w":"DANA","t":"Where would that be, usually?","em":[],"s":52.646,"e":54.968},{"w":"RAY","t":"It could be on a work surface, hidden in other material, or in the regular trash.","em":[],"s":54.968,"e":60.256},{"w":"RAY","t":"Imagine someone tosses a used blade into a regular trash bin, so the next person to reach in is at risk.","em":[],"s":60.256,"e":66.998},{"w":"DANA","t":"So one hazard is a container that still looks roomy, and the other is a sharp in the wrong place.","em":[],"s":66.998,"e":74.132},{"w":"RAY","t":"Yes, and spotting either one early is how you stop an injury before it happens.","em":[],"s":74.049,"e":79.69},{"w":"RAY","t":"So the rule is this: at the fill line, it's full.","em":[],"s":79.69,"e":83.673},{"w":"DANA","t":"My kitchen trash can could have used a fill line.","em":[],"s":83.673,"e":87.04}]},"02_02-k2-harder.mp3":{"dur":83.04,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Let's talk about sharps containers that are almost full.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":3.49},{"w":"DANA","t":"I'll be honest, if a bin looks like it has room, I just use it without checking the top.","em":[],"s":3.49,"e":9.221},{"w":"RAY","t":"Well, that's the tricky thing.","em":[],"s":9.221,"e":11.318},{"w":"RAY","t":"A container can be at its fill line and still have a gap at the top.","em":[],"s":11.318,"e":15.543},{"w":"RAY","t":"From where you're standing, it looks like there's room.","em":[],"s":15.543,"e":18.642},{"w":"DANA","t":"So how would I know it's full?","em":[],"s":18.642,"e":20.873},{"w":"RAY","t":"Look for the fill line, not the gap.","em":[7],"s":20.873,"e":23.267},{"w":"RAY","t":"Once the sharps reach that line, it's full.","em":[],"s":23.267,"e":26.114},{"w":"RAY","t":"Pushing another one in puts your hand close to what's already inside.","em":[],"s":26.114,"e":30.625},{"w":"DANA","t":"So the container can fool you.","em":[],"s":30.625,"e":32.821},{"w":"DANA","t":"Does that happen anywhere else?","em":[],"s":32.821,"e":35.087},{"w":"RAY","t":"Actually, it can happen with a regular trash bin too.","em":[],"s":35.087,"e":38.435},{"w":"RAY","t":"Imagine you walk past one, and something's half-hidden under paper towels, and you can't tell what it is.","em":[],"s":38.435,"e":45.004},{"w":"DANA","t":"So you've got a container with a gap at the top and something in a bin you can't identify.","em":[],"s":44.921,"e":51.009},{"w":"DANA","t":"Which one's the hazard?","em":[],"s":51.009,"e":52.607},{"w":"RAY","t":"both of them could be.","em":[0],"s":52.524,"e":54.012},{"w":"RAY","t":"A sharp that's hidden in other material or mixed into regular trash puts the next person at risk.","em":[],"s":54.012,"e":60.292},{"w":"DANA","t":"Even if you're not sure it's a sharp?","em":[],"s":60.21,"e":62.689},{"w":"RAY","t":"Yes, even then.","em":[],"s":62.689,"e":63.833},{"w":"RAY","t":"Spotting a hazard early prevents injuries, even when you can't be sure what it is yet.","em":[],"s":63.833,"e":69.466},{"w":"DANA","t":"So the hazard counts before you even know what it is.","em":[],"s":69.466,"e":73.019},{"w":"RAY","t":"That's it.","em":[],"s":73.019,"e":73.761},{"w":"RAY","t":"And for the container, the rule is simple: at the fill line, it's full.","em":[],"s":73.761,"e":78.556},{"w":"DANA","t":"Honestly, if it looked roomy, I figured it was fine.","em":[],"s":78.556,"e":83.04}]},"04_03-f2.mp3":{"dur":75.12,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"If I'm wearing thick gloves, do I even need a sharps container?","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":3.945},{"w":"RAY","t":"Well, it's a fair question, so let's make it a real choice.","em":[],"s":3.945,"e":7.965},{"w":"RAY","t":"Suppose a plant wants to protect its people, but it can only do one thing.","em":[],"s":7.965,"e":12.984},{"w":"RAY","t":"It can hand out heavier gloves, or it can put sharps containers on every line.","em":[],"s":12.984,"e":18.228},{"w":"DANA","t":"I think I'd pick the gloves.","em":[],"s":18.146,"e":20.016},{"w":"DANA","t":"They're right there on your hands.","em":[],"s":20.016,"e":22.274},{"w":"RAY","t":"That makes sense, and heavy-duty gloves do help.","em":[],"s":22.191,"e":25.354},{"w":"RAY","t":"They protect you against cuts and punctures.","em":[],"s":25.354,"e":28.218},{"w":"DANA","t":"I can hear a \"but\" coming.","em":[],"s":28.218,"e":30.695},{"w":"RAY","t":"The catch is that a needle can get through even a thick glove.","em":[9],"s":30.695,"e":34.913},{"w":"RAY","t":"Imagine a needle tip pressed against a heavy work glove, and it can still push through.","em":[],"s":34.913,"e":39.529},{"w":"DANA","t":"Huh.","em":[],"s":39.446,"e":39.812},{"w":"DANA","t":"I kind of assumed a thick glove would stop just about anything.","em":[],"s":39.812,"e":44.317},{"w":"DANA","t":"So what does the container do that the glove can't?","em":[],"s":44.317,"e":47.785},{"w":"RAY","t":"A safety-engineered sharps container is what's called an engineering control.","em":[],"s":47.785,"e":52.508},{"w":"RAY","t":"That means it works on the sharp itself, because once the sharp drops in, the container holds it inside.","em":[],"s":52.508,"e":58.848},{"w":"DANA","t":"So the gloves are on me, and the container is on the sharp.","em":[12],"s":58.848,"e":62.811},{"w":"RAY","t":"That's really the difference.","em":[],"s":62.811,"e":64.71},{"w":"DANA","t":"So is the glove enough on its own?","em":[],"s":64.71,"e":67.599},{"w":"RAY","t":"No.","em":[],"s":67.599,"e":67.877},{"w":"RAY","t":"The gloves still help, but on their own they give you less protection.","em":[],"s":67.877,"e":72.8},{"w":"DANA","t":"Okay.","em":[],"s":72.718,"e":73.23},{"w":"DANA","t":"That changes my answer.","em":[],"s":73.23,"e":75.12}]},"06_04-f1-normal.mp3":{"dur":88.8,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Here's a quick story about a needle that ended up in the regular trash.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":4.444},{"w":"DANA","t":"We'll let Jacob tell this story.","em":[],"s":4.444,"e":6.454},{"w":"BOYD","t":"Hey, my name's Jacob, and I work on the sanitation crew.","em":[],"s":6.454,"e":10.62},{"w":"BOYD","t":"It's the end of the day, and I'm pulling the bag out of the bin by the line.","em":[],"s":10.538,"e":15.031},{"w":"BOYD","t":"I tie it off and lift it, and something jabs me right through the plastic.","em":[],"s":14.95,"e":19.933},{"w":"BOYD","t":"I look down, and there's a needle sticking out the side of the bag.","em":[],"s":19.851,"e":24.334},{"w":"BOYD","t":"I never even saw it but it poked into my leg.","em":[],"s":24.334,"e":27.367},{"w":"DANA","t":"Ok, that's terrible.","em":[],"s":27.285,"e":29.031},{"w":"DANA","t":"So where did that needle come from?","em":[],"s":29.031,"e":32.024},{"w":"RAY","t":"It came from Chris, who works on the line.","em":[],"s":31.942,"e":34.744},{"w":"RAY","t":"He manages his diabetes with insulin.","em":[],"s":34.744,"e":37.17},{"w":"DANA","t":"So how does his needle end up in the trash?","em":[],"s":37.17,"e":40.438},{"w":"RAY","t":"One afternoon he's in the middle of a task, and he can't find a sharps container nearby.","em":[],"s":40.438,"e":46.23},{"w":"RAY","t":"So, just this once, he drops the used needle in the trash.","em":[3],"s":46.23,"e":50.078},{"w":"DANA","t":"You know, I can picture doing that.","em":[],"s":50.078,"e":52.486},{"w":"DANA","t":"You're busy, and the trash is right there.","em":[],"s":52.486,"e":55.306},{"w":"RAY","t":"And it's only one time, so it doesn't feel like a big deal.","em":[],"s":55.306,"e":59.227},{"w":"DANA","t":"But what about Jacob?","em":[],"s":59.227,"e":61.024},{"w":"RAY","t":"Jacob never used that needle, and he never saw it until it went through the bag.","em":[],"s":61.024,"e":66.56},{"w":"RAY","t":"And a needlestick can expose you to H-I-V, hepatitis B and hepatitis C.","em":[],"s":66.56,"e":71.481},{"w":"DANA","t":"And all he did was take out the trash.","em":[],"s":71.399,"e":74.667},{"w":"RAY","t":"That's the part that gets me.","em":[],"s":74.585,"e":76.776},{"w":"RAY","t":"Chris made the choice, but Jacob is the one who got stuck.","em":[],"s":76.776,"e":80.876},{"w":"RAY","t":"You know, a sharp in the wrong place can hurt someone who never handled it.","em":[13],"s":80.794,"e":85.451},{"w":"DANA","t":"The last bag you filled at work...","em":[],"s":85.369,"e":87.635},{"w":"DANA","t":"who picked it up?","em":[],"s":87.635,"e":88.8}]},"05_04-f1-addon.mp3":{"dur":19.6,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"So what happens after a needlestick like that?","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":2.57},{"w":"RAY","t":"There's a report to a supervisor, and then there's a medical evaluation, with testing for H-I-V and hepatitis B.","em":[],"s":2.57,"e":10.368},{"w":"DANA","t":"And what happens after the testing?","em":[],"s":10.368,"e":12.94},{"w":"RAY","t":"Then comes the waiting, and the results can take weeks.","em":[],"s":12.857,"e":17.005},{"w":"DANA","t":"That's a long time to carry a question around.","em":[],"s":16.922,"e":19.6}]},"08_05-f3-normal.mp3":{"dur":66.16,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"RAY","t":"Here's a number about what people actually do with used sharps.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":3.595},{"w":"RAY","t":"In one study, more than ninety percent of workers surveyed said they always use a sharps container.","em":[],"s":3.595,"e":8.562},{"w":"DANA","t":"always?","em":[0],"s":8.478,"e":9.146},{"w":"DANA","t":"To be honest, I'd have guessed about half.","em":[],"s":9.146,"e":12.734},{"w":"DANA","t":"When I think of a busy line, the container's always a long walk away.","em":[],"s":12.734,"e":17.627},{"w":"DANA","t":"So I picture people tossing blades in the trash.","em":[],"s":17.627,"e":20.994},{"w":"RAY","t":"That's the version people tend to tell each other.","em":[],"s":20.911,"e":23.928},{"w":"RAY","t":"But most people walk it over to the container.","em":[1],"s":23.928,"e":26.585},{"w":"RAY","t":"Imagine someone on the line finishes a blade change, so they walk the used blade down to the container.","em":[],"s":26.585,"e":32.843},{"w":"DANA","t":"And then what happens?","em":[],"s":32.759,"e":34.344},{"w":"RAY","t":"They drop it in and walk back to work, already thinking about the next job.","em":[],"s":34.344,"e":39.101},{"w":"DANA","t":"Then why does it feel like everyone uses the trash?","em":[],"s":39.017,"e":42.855},{"w":"RAY","t":"Because tossing it in the trash is the one you remember, and it's the one people bring up at lunch.","em":[],"s":42.772,"e":48.613},{"w":"RAY","t":"You know, nobody ever tells a story about walking to the container, because it's too normal to mention.","em":[],"s":48.529,"e":54.62},{"w":"DANA","t":"So the trash gets all the attention.","em":[],"s":54.537,"e":57.207},{"w":"RAY","t":"It does.","em":[],"s":57.207,"e":57.78},{"w":"RAY","t":"And the walk to the container is just what most people do on a normal day.","em":[],"s":57.78,"e":62.547},{"w":"DANA","t":"Next time I'm walking one down, I won't feel like the odd one out.","em":[],"s":62.464,"e":66.16}]},"07_05-f3-addon.mp3":{"dur":20.96,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"RAY","t":"Think about a normal shift, where blades get changed all morning.","em":[],"s":0.05,"e":3.805},{"w":"DANA","t":"So where does each of those blades end up?","em":[],"s":3.805,"e":6.642},{"w":"RAY","t":"Almost every one goes to the container.","em":[],"s":6.642,"e":9.18},{"w":"RAY","t":"Someone walks it down and walks back, and then someone else does the same thing.","em":[],"s":9.18,"e":14.318},{"w":"DANA","t":"And nobody says anything about it?","em":[],"s":14.235,"e":16.821},{"w":"RAY","t":"No, not a word.","em":[],"s":16.821,"e":18.04},{"w":"RAY","t":"Walking it down is just part of the job.","em":[],"s":18.04,"e":20.96}]},"09_06-close.mp3":{"dur":10.147,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"That's all for this one.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":1.403},{"w":"DANA","t":"Thanks for spending a few minutes with us.","em":[],"s":1.403,"e":3.816},{"w":"RAY","t":"Look after each other out there.","em":[],"s":3.816,"e":5.764},{"w":"RAY","t":"See you next time.","em":[],"s":5.764,"e":6.886}]},"CONTINUE.mp3":{"dur":2.742,"env":"cdkzqkec8974553332222abhgggeddeeffeecbb819bffacabfddee96gc9cccda887a986563000000000","sents":[{"w":"","t":"You may now continue the lesson.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":2.742}]},"10_qt-k1.mp3":{"dur":59.2,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Here's a quick one about a used blade.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":2.044},{"w":"DANA","t":"Say you've just finished a blade change, and the old blade is still in your hand.","em":[],"s":2.044,"e":6.959},{"w":"DANA","t":"What do you do with it?","em":[],"s":6.959,"e":8.394},{"w":"RAY","t":"Well, you might want to set it down for a minute, or drop it in the nearest trash can.","em":[],"s":8.394,"e":14.001},{"w":"RAY","t":"But neither one is safe.","em":[1],"s":14.001,"e":15.598},{"w":"DANA","t":"Why not, if it's only for a minute?","em":[],"s":15.515,"e":18.164},{"w":"RAY","t":"Because a used blade is a hazard even when it looks clean.","em":[],"s":18.164,"e":22.399},{"w":"RAY","t":"The next person who reaches for that spot, or that bag, is at risk.","em":[],"s":22.399,"e":26.279},{"w":"DANA","t":"So what's the right way to handle it?","em":[],"s":26.196,"e":28.763},{"w":"RAY","t":"There are four steps.","em":[],"s":28.763,"e":30.339},{"w":"RAY","t":"One, know your route to a sharps container before you start.","em":[],"s":30.339,"e":34.711},{"w":"RAY","t":"Two, use a safer tool if one will do the job.","em":[],"s":34.711,"e":38.012},{"w":"RAY","t":"Three, turn on the safety feature if there is one.","em":[],"s":38.012,"e":41.668},{"w":"RAY","t":"Four, put the used blade straight into a designated sharps container.","em":[],"s":41.668,"e":46.648},{"w":"DANA","t":"I guess that sounds simple enough.","em":[],"s":46.565,"e":48.877},{"w":"DANA","t":"Does it change if the container is far away?","em":[],"s":48.877,"e":51.698},{"w":"RAY","t":"No, it doesn't.","em":[],"s":51.698,"e":52.792},{"w":"RAY","t":"Actually, the whole rule comes down to this: a used blade goes straight into the container.","em":[12],"s":52.792,"e":59.068}]},"11_qt-k2.mp3":{"dur":54.48,"env":"","sents":[{"w":"DANA","t":"Here's a quick one about sharps containers.","em":[],"s":0.0,"e":2.546},{"w":"DANA","t":"Say you walk up to one, and it's past the fill line.","em":[],"s":2.546,"e":5.981},{"w":"DANA","t":"The used blades are crowded right at the opening.","em":[],"s":5.981,"e":9.228},{"w":"DANA","t":"What do you do?","em":[],"s":9.228,"e":10.213},{"w":"RAY","t":"Well, it's tempting to press them down to make room, or to squeeze one more in.","em":[],"s":10.213,"e":15.554},{"w":"DANA","t":"What's wrong with pressing them down?","em":[],"s":15.47,"e":17.556},{"w":"RAY","t":"Pressing down puts your hand right next to used blades.","em":[6],"s":17.473,"e":21.45},{"w":"RAY","t":"When a container reaches its fill line, it's full, so you use another designated container.","em":[],"s":21.45,"e":26.651},{"w":"DANA","t":"Okay.","em":[],"s":26.651,"e":27.085},{"w":"DANA","t":"Anything else I should be looking for?","em":[],"s":27.085,"e":29.905},{"w":"RAY","t":"Yes, a sharp that's out of place.","em":[],"s":29.905,"e":32.179},{"w":"RAY","t":"That could be on a work surface, hidden in other material, or in the regular trash.","em":[],"s":32.179,"e":37.799},{"w":"RAY","t":"Either way, it puts the next person at risk.","em":[],"s":37.799,"e":40.752},{"w":"DANA","t":"So there are really two different things to spot.","em":[],"s":40.669,"e":43.84},{"w":"RAY","t":"You know, that's exactly it, and spotting either one early prevents injuries.","em":[],"s":43.756,"e":48.93},{"w":"DANA","t":"Good to know.","em":[],"s":48.93,"e":50.181},{"w":"RAY","t":"Just remember that when a container is at the fill line, it's full.","em":[12],"s":50.181,"e":54.437}]}}